      "lines": [
        "来量度。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "水的汽化热是很大的：在温度 $100^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$ 时，为 $2.256\\times10^6$ 焦",
        "耳/千克，或 $539$ 卡/克。其他液体（酒精、乙醚、水银、汽油等）",
        "的汽化热是水的汽化热的 $\\frac{1}{3}\\sim\\frac{1}{10}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "质量为 $m$ 的液体转变为蒸汽，需要热量"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$Q_{\\text{汽}}=mL.$　$(4-1)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当蒸汽凝结时要放出相同的热量①："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$Q_{\\text{凝}}=-mL.$　$(4-2)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当温度升高时，汽化热减小，因为分子的动能随着温度的",
        "升高而增大。因此，内聚力（分子吸引力）很难维持运动很快",
        "的液体分子一个挨着一个。这时为了断绝一个分子与其他液",
        "体的联系，需要消耗的能量是较小的。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如，水的汽化热，随着温度的升高是这样的改变：在",
        "$0^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$ 时，汽化热为 $2.59\\times10^6$ 焦耳/千克；$50^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$ 时，为 $2.38\\times10^6$",
        "焦耳/千克；$100^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$ 时，为 $2.26\\times10^6$ 焦耳/千克；$200^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$ 时，为",
        "$1.96\\times10^6$ 焦耳/千克。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "38. 真实气体的等温线"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了说明气体转变为液体以及反变化的条件，只是简单",
        "地观察液体的蒸发或沸腾是不够的。需要仔细地研究在不同",
        "温度下真实气体的压强和体积的变化。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
